# Antra environment template.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (never commit the real file).
#
# Used by Pages Functions locally (`wrangler pages dev`) and in production as a
# secret:  npx wrangler pages secret put JWT_SECRET
JWT_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string-at-least-32-chars
ENVIRONMENT=development
# Optional: override the password-hashing work factor. The default (70000) is
# tuned for the Workers free-tier CPU limit; local dev has no such limit, so you
# can raise this if you like.
# PBKDF2_ITERATIONS=100000
